@BaseUrl = http://localhost:5165

### API Discovery Info
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api
Accept: application/json

### Health Check
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List Students (with filtering, sorting, pagination)
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api/students?page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=id&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

### Filter Students by Department & Search
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api/students?department=Computer%20Science&search=Aarav
Accept: application/json

### Get Student Statistics
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api/students/stats
Accept: application/json

### Get Student by ID
GET {{BaseUrl}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Student
POST {{BaseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ananya",
  "lastName": "Iyer",
  "email": "ananya.iyer@university.edu",
  "enrollmentNumber": "CS2025010",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "semester": 3,
  "gpa": 9.15,
  "enrollmentDate": "2025-08-01"
}

### Update Student
PUT {{BaseUrl}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aarav",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "email": "aarav.sharma@university.edu",
  "enrollmentNumber": "CS2024001",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "semester": 6,
  "gpa": 9.10,
  "enrollmentDate": "2024-08-01",
  "isActive": true
}

### Patch Student Status
PATCH {{BaseUrl}}/api/students/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete Student
DELETE {{BaseUrl}}/api/students/4
Accept: application/json

